<!--
  The hardened runtime's entitlements for Clauseo.app: tauri.conf.json's bundle.macOS.entitlements.
  The bundler passes this file to every codesign it runs: the .app, its main binary and the
  externalBin sidecars in Contents/MacOS. The helpers in Contents/Helpers (agent-browser, stetdoc,
  pdftoppm, pdfinfo, pdftotext) are signed by release.yml with none. Empty on purpose: nothing Clauseo runs
  needs an exception (decision 0035, "Apple Developer ID", says why each common one is left out).
  Never add com.apple.security.get-task-allow: release.yml's Developer ID check and
  release-apple.test.mjs refuse it.
-->
